      "message": "When building a GSI target, the L3QS entry causes the following error:\n\n```\nerror: build/make/target/product/gsi/Android.bp:84:1: \"android_gsi\" depends on undefined module \"Launcher3QuickStep\".\nOr did you mean [\"Launcher3QuickStepLib\"]?\n```\n\nTrebuchetQuickStep should\u0027ve overridden L3QS, but for some reason isn\u0027t picked up.\n\nLikewise, Aperture should\u0027ve overridden Camera2. Having Camera2 doesn\u0027t cause a build-time error, but the resulting build contains Camera2, when it should contain Aperture instead.\n\nThis crudely fixes both.",
